              "instruction": "a banknote, loose change, a salary, a profit, a loss",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: a banknote, loose change, a salary, a profit, a loss]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "a team, business, a company, the government, marks",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: a team, business, a company, the government, marks]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "recall",
          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A banknote? (నోటు, nōṭu.) Loose change? (చిల్లర, cillara.) A salary? (జీతం, jītaṁ.) A profit? (లాభం, lābhaṁ.) A loss? (నష్టం, naṣṭaṁ.) A team? (జట్టు, jaṭṭu.) Business? (వ్యాపారం, vyāpāraṁ.) A company? (కంపెనీ, kampenī.) The government? (ప్రభుత్వం, prabhutvaṁ.) Marks? (మార్కులు, mārkulu.)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
